                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/member/profile",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["{{apiVersion}}", "member", "profile"]
                },
                "description": "Partial update; unknown keys are rejected. At least one field must be supplied.\n\nField rules\n- `firstName` (≤40), `lastName` (≤80), `phone` (≤32), `postalCode` (≤16), `preferredStore` (≤64) — send `null` to clear, blank strings are rejected.\n- `phoneType` — `mobile` | `home`, only meaningful when `phone` is also sent."
              },
              "event": [
